<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 73.8049 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 73.8049 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 73.8049 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Monday from 73.6952 on Friday.</p>
<p>				    Dec 30		  Dec 27</p>
<p>    tenge per dollar	  73.8049		 73.6952</p>
<p>    volume ($ mnl)	    11.215		  11.590</p>
<p>				    Dec 30		  Dec 24</p>
<p>    tenge per mark	    47.7000		 47.1819</p>
<p>    volume (DM million)	    0.005		   0.080</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
